      "source": "A list of <a href=\"ValueCodeGenerator.Delegate.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.aot.generate\"><code>ValueCodeGenerator.Delegate</code></a> implementations for the following common value\ntypes.\n<ul>\n<li>Primitive types</li>\n<li>String</li>\n<li>Charset</li>\n<li>Enum</li>\n<li>Class</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../core/ResolvableType.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.core\"><code>ResolvableType</code></a></li>\n<li>Array</li>\n<li>List via <code>List.of</code></li>\n<li>Set via <code>Set.of</code> and support for <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/LinkedHashSet.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>LinkedHashSet</code></a></li>\n<li>Map via <code>Map.of</code> or <code>Map.ofEntries</code></li>\n</ul>\nThose implementations do not require the <a href=\"ValueCodeGenerator.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.aot.generate\"><code>ValueCodeGenerator</code></a> to be\n<a href=\"ValueCodeGenerator.html#scoped(org.springframework.aot.generate.GeneratedMethods)\">scoped</a>.",
      "translation": "以下是针对常见值类型的 <a href=\"ValueCodeGenerator.Delegate.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.aot.generate\"><code>ValueCodeGenerator.Delegate</code></a> 实现列表。\n<ul>\n<li>基本类型</li>\n<li>String</li>\n<li>Charset</li>\n<li>Enum</li>\n<li>Class</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../core/ResolvableType.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.core\"><code>ResolvableType</code></a></li>\n<li>Array</li>\n<li>通过 <code>List.of</code> 实现的 List</li>\n<li>通过 <code>Set.of</code> 实现的 Set，并支持 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/LinkedHashSet.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>LinkedHashSet</code></a></li>\n<li>通过 <code>Map.of</code> 或 <code>Map.ofEntries</code> 实现的 Map</li>\n</ul>\n这些实现不需要将 <a href=\"ValueCodeGenerator.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.aot.generate\"><code>ValueCodeGenerator</code></a> 设置为\n<a href=\"ValueCodeGenerator.html#scoped(org.springframework.aot.generate.GeneratedMethods)\">scoped</a>。",
      "count": 2
